{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1151","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Number of Components"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Kingdom of Kremland is a tree (a connected undirected graph without cycles) consisting of $$$n$$$ vertices. Each vertex $$$i$$$ has its own value $$$a_i$$$. All vertices are connected in series by edges. Formally, for every $$$1 \\leq i \\lt n$$$ there is an edge between the vertices of $$$i$$$ and $$$i+1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Denote the function $$$f(l, r)$$$, which takes two integers $$$l$$$ and $$$r$$$ ($$$l \\leq r$$$):"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" We leave in the tree only vertices whose values ​​range from $$$l$$$ to $$$r$$$.   "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The value of the function will be the number of connected components in the new graph. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to calculate the following sum: $$$$$$\\sum_{l=1}^{n} \\sum_{r=l}^{n} f(l, r) $$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq n \\leq 10^5$$$) — the number of vertices in the tree."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\ldots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\leq a_i \\leq n$$$) — the values of the vertices."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print one number — the answer to the problem."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n3\n2 1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n2 1 1 3\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n11"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10\n1 5 2 5 5 3 10 6 5 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n104"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, the function values ​​will be as follows: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 1)=1$$$ (there is only a vertex with the number $$$2$$$, which forms one component) "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 2)=1$$$ (there are vertices $$$1$$$ and $$$2$$$ that form one component) "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 3)=1$$$ (all vertices remain, one component is obtained) "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2, 2)=1$$$ (only vertex number $$$1$$$) "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2, 3)=2$$$ (there are vertices $$$1$$$ and $$$3$$$ that form two components) "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(3, 3)=1$$$ (only vertex $$$3$$$) "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" Totally out $$$7$$$."},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, the function values ​​will be as follows: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 1)=1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 2)=1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 3)=1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(1, 4)=1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2, 2)=1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2, 3)=2$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(2, 4)=2$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(3, 3)=1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(3, 4)=1$$$ "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$f(4, 4)=0$$$ (there is no vertex left, so the number of components is $$$0$$$) "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"kind":"text","text":" Totally out $$$11$$$."}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1151E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1151/problem/E"}